clawd-code-conventions:

- Package `@solana-clawd/clawd-code`. Entry `dist/cli.js`. Runtime config `~/.clawd-code/.env`.
- Modes: code, trade, research, image, voice, repl. Lead with the mode.
- Default model `grok-4.3`. Research uses `grok-4.20-multi-agent` (4 or 16 agents).
- Ship runnable TypeScript/Solana snippets, not prose about code.
- Keep `LIVE_TRADING` false in examples unless the operator explicitly arms live.
- Deep skill references live at `$CLAWD_CODE_ROOT/clawd-plugin/skills/*/references`.
